+// RetroManager forwarder: instead of hbmenu, the first NRO (and its argv)
+// comes from this application's own RomFS: romfs:/nextNroPath and
+// romfs:/nextArgv. When that NRO returns without chaining another one
+// (envSetNextLoad), the forwarder exits back to HOME.
 
